{"municipality_code":"03461","pref":"岩手県","city":"大槌町","headline":"公園・遊具や史跡・遺跡が、この街を歩く手がかりになりそうです。","display_comment_enriched":"大槌町には、金沢村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には史跡や遺跡、城跡や陣屋跡、寺社や信仰の場にまつわる場所が点在し、「大槌城跡」、「碇川台場跡」、「大槌通代官所跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板、金沢村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が、地域の歴史を読み解く手がかりになるでしょう。 川沿いや水辺では、その土地の暮らしや水との関わりを伝える歴史案内板が見つかるかもしれません。 「大槌城址」や「蓬萊島」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":78,"rank":711,"percentile":62.4,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":17,"rank":752,"percentile":59.6,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":25,"rank":1017,"percentile":45.0,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":7,"rank":1128,"percentile":34.2,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":2,"rank":1181,"percentile":27.7,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":6,"rank":699,"percentile":57.7,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":4,"rank":1422,"percentile":22.5,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":[],"tourism_landmarks":["大槌城址","蓬萊島","浪板海岸（なみいたか